  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 2716,
      "text": "No nation can bring its appointed time forward, nor can it delay it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 345,
      "ruku": 297,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2717,
      "text": "Then We sent Our messengers in succession: every time a messenger came to his people, they rejected him. So We destroyed them, one after the others, and made them mere tales[14]. Away with the people who refuse to believe[15]!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 44,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 345,
      "ruku": 297,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2718,
      "text": "Then We sent Moses and his brother Aaron with Our signs[16] and compelling proof[17]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 345,
      "ruku": 297,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2719,
      "text": "to Pharaoh and his chiefs, but they showed arrogance and were haughty people.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 46,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 345,
      "ruku": 297,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2720,
      "text": "They said, “Should we believe in two men like ourselves when their people are our slaves?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 47,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 345,
      "ruku": 297,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2721,
      "text": "So they rejected them both and were among those who were destroyed.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 345,
      "ruku": 297,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2722,
      "text": "We gave Moses the Scripture so that they[18] might be guided.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 345,
      "ruku": 297,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2723,
      "text": "We made the son of Mary and his mother a sign[19] and sheltered them on a hillside – a place of rest and a flowing stream[20].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 345,
      "ruku": 297,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2724,
      "text": "O messengers[21], eat from the lawful things[22] and act righteously, for I am All-Knowing of what you do.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 51,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 345,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2725,
      "text": "Indeed, this religion of yours is one religion[23], and I am your Lord, so fear Me.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 345,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2726,
      "text": "But people split up their religion into factions, each faction rejoicing in what it has[24].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 53,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 345,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2727,
      "text": "So leave them in their heedlessness for a while.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 54,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 345,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2728,
      "text": "Do they think that what We give them wealth and children,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 55,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 345,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2729,
      "text": "that We hasten to them all that is good? No, but they do not perceive it[25].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 56,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 345,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2730,
      "text": "Those who are in awe for fear of their Lord[26],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 57,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 345,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2731,
      "text": "and those who believe in the verses of their Lord,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 58,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 345,
      "ruku": 298,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2732,
      "text": "and those who do not associate partners with their Lord,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
